{"id":"n66878-2-8","stage":5,"title":"앞당기다 · 提前","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66878-2-8-1","ko":"내일부터는 회사에 한 시간 일찍 출근하려고 해.","zh":"从明天开始，我打算提前一小时去公司上班。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일부터는","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"大概","explanation":"한：大概","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"3","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간","meaning":"小时","explanation":"시간：小时","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62842","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출근하려고","meaning":"上班","explanation":"출근하다：上班；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"출근하다","audio":"/audio/c9a21c441e737abe8903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62368","senseId":"1","lemma":"출근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"大概","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"大约估计。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"小时","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62842","definition":"时间单位。表示一天的二十四分之一时长。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"c9a21c441e737abe","term":"출근하다","zh":"上班","audio":"/audio/c9a21c441e737abe8903.mp3","entryId":"62368","definition":"去单位工作。","pronunciation":["출근하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9a503776e324f1968cf6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66878-2-8-2","ko":"해가 일찍 뜨니까 출근 시간을 앞당겼구나.","zh":"因为太阳升起得早，所以才把上班时间提前了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"해가","meaning":"太阳","explanation":"해：太阳；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72468","senseId":"1","lemma":"해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜨니까","meaning":"漂，浮","explanation":"뜨다：漂，浮；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66028","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출근","meaning":"上班","explanation":"출근：上班","readings":[{"term":"출근","audio":"/audio/0ece90941e0c8568c6d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72139","senseId":"1","lemma":"출근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간을","meaning":"小时","explanation":"시간：小时；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62842","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞당겼구나.","meaning":"提前，提早","explanation":"앞당기다：提前，提早；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"앞당기다","audio":"/audio/2ed6f6475d058633b184.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66878","senseId":"2","lemma":"앞당기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b4ec4274b7799f1f","term":"해","zh":"太阳","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3","entryId":"72468","definition":"位于太阳系的中心，温度极高，自行发光的恒星。","pronunciation":["해"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"83c29e672f4ac6fe","term":"뜨다","zh":"漂，浮","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3","entryId":"66028","definition":"在水面上或空中，或向上涌起。","pronunciation":["뜨다"]},{"id":"0ece90941e0c8568","term":"출근","zh":"上班","audio":"/audio/0ece90941e0c8568c6d5.mp3","entryId":"72139","definition":"去单位工作。","pronunciation":["출근"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"小时","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62842","definition":"时间单位。表示一天的二十四分之一时长。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"2ed6f6475d058633","term":"앞당기다","zh":"提前，提早","audio":"/audio/2ed6f6475d058633b184.mp3","entryId":"66878","definition":"将已经定下的时间或约定向前移动。","pronunciation":["압땅기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec0390cc1e4f3f5c027e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.316,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66878","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":158,"sequenceScore":3.1427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为太阳升起得早，所以才把上班时间提前了啊。","从明天开始，我打算提前一小时去公司上班。","我们这个假期要不要一起去旅行呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["从明天开始，我打算提前一小时去公司上班。","我们这个假期要不要一起去旅行呢？","因为太阳升起得早，所以才把上班时间提前了啊。"],"answer":2}]}
